From: Shimazu <vanessimbolon2020@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 02:19:04 +0000
Subject: TridentShootHandler: Replace SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater with GlobalRegionScheduler and rename obfuscated vars

AE PATCH REASON: SchedulerUtils is stripped and throws UnsupportedOperationException on Folia; delayed trident cleanup must run on a Folia scheduler; obfuscated variable names reduce maintainability.
AE PATCH FIX: Replace SchedulerUtils.runTaskLater with Bukkit.getGlobalRegionScheduler().runDelayed (1L tick). Remove SchedulerUtils import; add ScheduledTask, EffectsHandler, and Bukkit imports. Rename var1/var2/var0 to event/shooter/uuid.
AE PATCH RISK: LOW - MIGRATE: SchedulerUtils → GlobalRegionScheduler. RF: var rename. No behavior change.

